Hi Tracy,

Thanks for walking through the intake boundary with us today. Attached is the=
 print copy of the briefing for the Office shift lead. Would you pass it alon=
g to them? It includes the routing diagram and the four July examples we disc=
ussed.

On August 13 at 11:00 a.m. Denver time (noon in Chicago), we'll use those fou=
r examples to practice from receipt through handoff, using paper and your exi=
sting communication route. The shift lead can record and acknowledge an inqui=
ry; a request to change the distribution list or grant access waits for your =
decision. We won't change the list or access during the exercise.

I'll prepare a sheet for the practice. Please let me know if the shift lead h=
as any questions about the print copy before then.

Thanks,
Darren

